The requested single HTML file has been generated. It provides a split-pane interface: a sidebar to input whatever odds-and-ends you find, and a main display that automatically parses and prioritizes the items into an immediate culinary battle plan.

The application uses an internal urgency filter. Typing descriptors like "(expires tomorrow)", "wilted", "open 3 days", or "soft" automatically pushes those ingredients into the **Priority 1: Use Within 12 Hours** tier with structural cooking strategies (skillets, hashes, dynamic bakes). Sturdier items and pantry cans populate the **Priority 2** tier to stretch the meal or create prep-ahead frameworks. A permanent **Preservation** tier offers quick guidelines for freezing whatever you cannot finish today.

