                        <li><strong>Tactical Adjustments:</strong> Combine any open dairy products or wilting greens together first. Cook down proteins thoroughly to lock in structural integrity.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>`;
        }

        // Tier 2: Mid-Range Defensive Strategies (3-5 Days Remaining)
        if (tier2.length > 0) {
            const combinedTier2 = tier2.map(i => `<span>${i.name} (${i.portions})</span>`).join('');

            html += `
            <div class="timeline-section">
                <div class="timeline-header">
                    <span class="badge warning">Tier 2</span> Next 2-3 Days Setup
                </div>
                <div class="recipe-card warning">
                    <div class="recipe-title">Defensive Cooking & Prep Ahead</div>
                    <div class="used-ingredients"><strong>Staggered Action:</strong> ${combinedTier2}</div>
                    <ul class="instructions">
                        <li><strong>Lifespan Extension:</strong> If any tracking items here are fresh produce or vegetables, roast them at 400°F (200°C) with oil and spices to alter their moisture footprint and buy another 4 days.</li>
                        <li><strong>Pantry Intersect:</strong> Deploy these items alongside your canned configurations or dry stocks to stretch volume into casseroles or foundational stews.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>`;
        }

        // Tier 3: High Stability / Flexibility (6+ Days Remaining)
        if (tier3.length > 0) {
            const combinedTier3 = tier3.map(i => `<span>${i.name}</span>`).join('');

            html += `
            <div class="timeline-section">
                <div class="timeline-header">
                    <span class="badge flex">Tier 3</span> Stable Strategic Reserve
                </div>
                <div class="recipe-card flex">
                    <div class="recipe-title">Pantry Buffer & Preservation Timing</div>
                    <div class="used-ingredients"><strong>Flexible:</strong> ${combinedTier3}</div>
