                        <li><strong>Pre-emptive Action:</strong> If you realize your schedule won't allow you to execute Priority 2 items later this week, migrate these Tier 3 items to the freezer immediately to halt the timeline.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>`;
        }

